 ine.gov\nDHHS\n→\nOffice of MaineCare Services (OMS)\n→\nProvider Reso
 urces\n→\n	 \n			Primary Care Plus (PCPlus) Quality Webinar: Performance
  Based Adjustment\nPrimary Care Plus (PCPlus) Quality Webinar: Performance
  Based Adjustment\nOct 09\, 2026\nWe invite PCPlus providers to a quality 
 webinar series that educates providers and administrators on best practice
 s related to quality measures in the PCPlus program. This series helps pra
 ctices optimize their performance and payment while aligning with industry
  best practices for population and patient health. MaineCare PCPlus qualit
 y measures can be found on the\nPCPlus webpage\n.\nJoin us on\nOctober 23\
 , 2026\, from 12:00-1:00 PM\nfor our next webinar to learn about Performan
 ce Based Adjustment (PBA). More information about PBA can be found on the\
 nDelivery System Reform webpage\n.\nPlease register\nin advance for this m
 eeting. After registering\, you will receive a confirmation email with inf
 ormation about joining the meeting.  in advance for this meeting. After 
 registering\, you will receive a confirmation email with information about
  joining the meeting.\nFor questions about PCPlus\, please contact us at\n
 PCP-Network-Services.DHHS@maine.gov\n.\nhttps://www.maine.gov/dhhs/oms/pro
 viders/provider-bulletins/primary-care-plus-pcplus-quality-webinar-perform
 ance-based-adjustment-2026-10-09
